# Windsurf Cascade Rules

## Engineering Standards
- **Read First:** Always inspect the target directory and existing components before writing code.
- **Atomic Commits:** Limit file edits to the immediate scope of the user request.
- **Type Safety:** Use strict TypeScript interfaces. Ban `any` types for core data structures.
- **Secret Isolation:** Keep API keys in `.env` accessed server-side only.

## Debugging Workflow
- When an error occurs, identify the root cause before editing code.
- Never add silent catch blocks that swallow runtime errors.
- If 2 patch attempts fail, request terminal logs and network tab payloads.
